% The revision table in the upper right corner, on the sheets that
% have revisions: its title, its heads and a row of .25 in for each.
/RX BW 7 sub def /RT BH 0.5 sub def /RR 0.25 def
Revisions length 0 gt {
  /n Revisions length def
  [ (REVISIONS) ] RX 3.25 add RT RR 2 div sub 0 0.12 1 TX
