[ (FINISH) ] 0.08 1.31 0.1 0 BT
[ (DO NOT SCALE DRAWING) ] 1 0.2 0.12 1 BT
[ (UNLESS OTHERWISE SPECIFIED,) ] 2.1 2.36 0.1 0 BT
